[32m+[m[32m## Gemini Configuration[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project uses the Gemini API for incident decisions.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCreate a `.env` file based on `.env.example`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRequired Gemini variables:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```env[m
[32m+[m[32mGEMINI_API_KEY=[m
[32m+[m[32mGEMINI_MODEL=[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- `GEMINI_API_KEY` is your private Gemini API key.[m
[32m+[m[32m- `GEMINI_MODEL` is the Gemini model used by the service.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe real `.env` file must not be committed to Git.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## AI Decisions[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mGemini receives:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- the ServiceNow incident[m
[32m+[m[32m- the five supplied knowledge-base articles[m
[32m+[m[32m- the decision rules from `prompt.txt`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe model must return exactly one of:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- `respond`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `ask`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `escalate`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Respond[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUsed when a supplied knowledge-base article clearly covers the issue and the ticket contains enough information to apply the solution.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Ask[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUsed when a knowledge-base article may apply, but the incident is too vague or incomplete to determine that confidently.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Escalate[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUsed when none of the supplied knowledge-base articles covers the issue.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mGemini is instructed to use only the provided knowledge base.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Knowledge Base[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe approved knowledge base is stored in:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mdata/kb_articles.json[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIt contains five articles covering:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Printer not printing[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Email not sending[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Cannot access system[m
[32m+[m[32m4. Slow network[m
[32m+[m[32m5. Browser pages not loading[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe Gemini prompt must use these articles and no other knowledge source.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Gemini Prompt[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe exact prompt sent to Gemini is stored in:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mprompt.txt[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe prompt defines:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- knowledge-base restrictions[m
[32m+[m[32m- `respond`, `ask`, and `escalate` rules[m
[32m+[m[32m- JSON output requirements[m
[32m+[m[32m- the incident and knowledge-base placeholders[m
[32m+[m
